items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff.name=Copper building staff
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff.description=Primary sends a guiding bolt through blocks to the nearest assembly preview in range. Hold secondary and aim through blocks at that preview to channel and place building nodes after a brief hold (town build permission). Fills up to <color is="#4ade80">3×3×3</color> highlighted building nodes around your aim at once. While held, grants <color is="#60a5fa">+150 max mana</color>; each placed block costs <color is="#60a5fa">1 mana</color>. Mana refills faster if you stop using secondary for a couple of seconds. Higher-tier staves grant more mana and recover it faster. Passive plot assembly still progresses while you are away.
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Iron.name=Iron building staff
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Iron.description=Same as the copper building staff. Secondary fills up to <color is="#4ade80">5×5×5</color> highlighted building nodes at once. While held, grants <color is="#60a5fa">+250 max mana</color> and faster mana recovery; each placed block costs <color is="#60a5fa">1 mana</color>.
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Thorium.name=Thorium building staff
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Thorium.description=Same as the copper building staff. Secondary fills up to <color is="#4ade80">7×7×7</color> highlighted building nodes at once. While held, grants <color is="#60a5fa">+400 max mana</color> and faster mana recovery; each placed block costs <color is="#60a5fa">1 mana</color>.
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Cobalt.name=Cobalt building staff
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Cobalt.description=Same as the copper building staff. Secondary fills up to <color is="#4ade80">9×9×9</color> highlighted building nodes at once. While held, grants <color is="#60a5fa">+600 max mana</color> and faster mana recovery; each placed block costs <color is="#60a5fa">1 mana</color>.
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Adamantite.name=Adamantite building staff
items.Aetherhaven_Building_Staff_Adamantite.description=Same as the copper building staff. Secondary fills up to <color is="#4ade80">11×11×11</color> highlighted building nodes at once. While held, grants <color is="#60a5fa">+900 max mana</color> and faster mana recovery; each placed block costs <color is="#60a5fa">1 mana</color>.
